772
53:54.024 --> 53:55.024
Actually...

773
53:57.354 --> 53:59.034
I want to do something else as well.

774
54:03.324 --> 54:04.024
What is it?

775
54:11.954 --> 54:12.954
Can I say it?

776
54:16.304 --> 54:18.204
If you don't say it,

777
54:19.334 --> 54:20.644
I'll do it myself.

778
54:25.844 --> 54:27.034
Say it again.

779
54:28.934 --> 54:29.934
Say what?

780
54:31.874 --> 54:33.624
Say that I'm your "girlfriend."

781
54:38.934 --> 54:44.244
♫Like the sunlight♫

782
54:44.424 --> 54:46.684
♫Providing warm embrace♫

783
54:46.704 --> 54:50.274
♫Always being near, hugging you tight,♫

784
54:50.304 --> 54:54.324
♫So you don't shed a tear♫

785
55:00.994 --> 55:02.514
Can you do it for me, girlfriend?

786
55:03.054 --> 55:04.784
♫When you look up high♫

787
55:04.804 --> 55:08.294
♫The Sun will be there, shining in the sky♫

788
55:08.514 --> 55:11.254
♫'Cause I'm your SUN♫

789
