♫When you look up high♫

792
55:20.834 --> 55:24.534
♫The Sun will be there, shining in the sky♫

793
55:24.554 --> 55:27.874
♫'Cause I'm your SUN♫

794
55:27.904 --> 55:34.824
♫If you have to face the storm, once the rain goes by♫

795
55:34.854 --> 55:36.584
♫When you look up high♫

796
55:36.604 --> 55:40.414
♫The Sun will be there, shining in the sky♫

797
55:40.434 --> 55:43.354
♫'Cause I'm your SUN♫

798
55:43.374 --> 55:46.554
♫I'll be your sun, you'll be my sky♫

799
56:02.954 --> 56:04.434
Why is it so hard?

800
56:13.774 --> 56:16.334
[Chris]

801
56:38.494 --> 56:40.684
[How to make a flower ring]

802
56:45.154 --> 56:46.204
[Chris]

803
56:52.444 --> 56:53.314
Chris,

804
56:54.024 --> 56:55.724
how do I make a flower ring?

805
56:57.124 --> 56:57.964
Sun,

806
57:01.014 --> 57:02.434
can we meet?

807
57:09.774 --> 57:11.634
We haven't seen each other in a long time.

808
57:16.134 --> 57:17.344
Why are you back?

809
57:24.244 --> 57:26.334
It's been years,

810
57:26.444 --> 57:28.424
and you're still just as selfish, huh?

811
57:29.734 --> 57:31.344
Stop bothering Chris already.

812
57:32.134 --> 57:33.334
I'm sorry.

813
57:34.324 --> 57:35.654
I can't do that.

814
57:36.124 --> 57:37.424
I love Chris.

815
57:41.874 --> 57:43.544
Only for now.

816
57:44.744 --> 57:47.844
Once Chris learns what you did,

817
57:48.174 --> 57:49.254
do you really think

818
57:50.664 --> 57:52.554
she'll still love you?

819
57:53.934 --> 57:55.724
Chris will leave you

820
57:56.854 --> 57:58.314
just like you left her.

821
58:26.244 --> 58:27.534
I know everything now.

822
58:29.304 --> 58:30.834
Let's end things here.

823
58:39.624 --> 58:40.894
You still cared?

824
58:40.924 --> 58:42.534
If you enjoy playing the victim,

825
58:42.734 --> 58:44.694
then don't try to make me the villain, Nadear.

826
58:44.714 --> 58:46.544
You can say whatever you want to me,

827
58:46.564 --> 58:47.304
but don't say

828
58:47.694 --> 58:49.044
that you have no one left.

829
58:51.254 --> 58:53.244
I won't make the same mistake again.

830
58:54.984 --> 58:55.694
Sun!

831
58:56.414 --> 58:57.854
The truth between you and Sun.

832
58:58.054 --> 58:59.054
What truth?

833
58:59.184 --> 59:01.414
Our relationship was wrong from the beginning.

834
59:18.134 --> 59:28.054
♫The rain keeps splashing beneath our cover,♫

835
